{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96996af0f8a7116dafb9bc737fd203584ac50e351430adcd82c4af8c333871ab",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:578c2b6630e954d7b2c2c7ab1dd26e051260be8ef5e682c25efff3136607f4cf",
      "text": "相互启发绽放繁花",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2188c6a569d5f1102c8dcf1a1a32039d8ea2a7424697b666fbed222b6d13f00f",
      "text": "这……这个演出构想，真是绝妙的点子喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a6b399ce6a439192b27aea105603e7237e39c9e4c380eaf93ed54887516ea9",
      "text": "这样一来，就能把吾辈们的个性\n啪啪～地展现得淋漓尽致了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89daa8fcb1a3f2e251032ceda67561e11218527da3c8387abcdf93f947601bc9",
      "text": "猫柳先生总是净说些天马行空的话，\n一度真不知道该如何收场是好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fff453d169d58a0d97a0e19aad914af3aea581092225ceecc6455f4ab362d0c6",
      "text": "多亏神速一魂的两位过来了，\n总算成型了，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a80e7887991d6ea922276c24a3df32ecdf91d77f8cc29da84965819efd7bc395",
      "text": "对方好像也挺高兴说得到了启发，\n能好好聊聊真是太好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f584f0789585766e9a4bcefd1d5ada35239bec5277368a55bf4d8f67b896c1",
      "text": "毕竟这次是全员齐心协力共同打造的特别演唱会，\n交流是非常重要的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a15e4ca724b654e029b85203d49e551ea9edf32f4effd9b787e32ec985d5c6",
      "text": "彼此相互启发，在观众席绽放出笑容之花，\n这也是一种优美的艺术形态喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3d093f9102567269dccd33f08334c405bca313ff8643f18e0e75b593624bfc",
      "text": "呵呵，是呀。不仅是服装，新曲和演唱会\n集结大家的力量，肯定会变得非常棒的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ef905f4828fb63d6e858becc21c709407dee0798c70fe08156880b29fcd23ce",
      "text": "一起开会的F-LAGS各位，\n看到这个方案也很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_004_22_5_06_004_22:5_06_004_22:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b242c1c97a772e909221731321031c0c72afa3ac2aa6b2d8968d928f3835b30",
      "text": "嗯。登上舞台的那一天，\n现在就已经期待得不得了了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
